-- Vòng lặp Auto Farm chính (ổn định vị trí, không rung lắc + Silent NPC + tự đổi vũ khí khi farm Mastery)
task.spawn(function()
    while task.wait(0.05) do
        if Config.AutoSelected or Config.AutoNear then
            pcall(function()
                local target = nil
                if Config.AutoSelected then
                    target = FindNearestMob(4500, Config.SelectedMob)
                elseif Config.AutoNear then
                    target = FindNearestMob(Config.NearRange, nil)
                end

                if IsAliveMob(target) then
                    currentFarmTarget = target
                    local anchor = target.HumanoidRootPart.Position
                    activeAnchorPos = anchor
                    local targetName = target.Name

                    while (Config.AutoSelected or Config.AutoNear) and IsAliveMob(target) do
                        currentFarmTarget = target
                        AutoHaki()
                        BringMobs(anchor, targetName)
                        if Config.AutoV4 then
                            TryActivateV4()
                        end

                        local usingMastery = TryMasterySkills(target)
                        if not usingMastery then
                            EquipWeapon(GetActiveWeapon())
                        end

                        local hrp = GetHRP()
                        local hoverPos = anchor + Vector3.new(0, Config.FarmHeight, 0)
                        if hrp then
                            local distToHover = (hoverPos - hrp.Position).Magnitude
                            if distToHover > 75 then
                                MoveToCFrame(CFrame.new(hoverPos))
                            else
                                HoldStablePosition(hoverPos, anchor)
                            end
                        end

                        if not usingMastery then
                            AttackClick()
                        end
                        task.wait(0.05)
                    end

                    -- Hết quái hoặc quái vừa chết: trả về vũ khí farm chính
                    currentFarmTarget = nil
                    isMasterySwitched = false
                    EquipWeapon(GetActiveWeapon())
                else
                    currentFarmTarget = nil
                    activeAnchorPos = nil
                    isMasterySwitched = false
                    ClearVisualHitboxes()
                    task.wait(0.25)
                end
            end)
        else
            currentFarmTarget = nil
            activeAnchorPos = nil
            isMasterySwitched = false
            ClearVisualHitboxes()
            task.wait(0.2)
        end
    end
end)
